<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Origins with a Perspective on Human Potential</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Equity: the assumptions we make in learning. A Zimbabwe perspective on capability, credentials, and what we might be measuring wrong - by Bryan Fawcett.">
    <meta name="author" content="Bryan Fawcett">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#00A651">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://bryanfawcett.com/origins-with-perspective">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">

    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Origins with a Perspective on Human Potential">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Equity: the assumptions we make in learning. A Zimbabwe perspective on capability, credentials, and what we might be measuring wrong.">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://bryanfawcett.com/origins-with-perspective">
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Bryan Fawcett">

    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:creator" content="@bryanfawcett">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Origins with a Perspective on Human Potential">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Equity: the assumptions we make in learning. A Zimbabwe perspective on capability, credentials, and what we might be measuring wrong.">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        body {
            overflow-x: hidden;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)),
                        url('/african-savanna-background.jpg') center/cover fixed;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.7;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        .zimbabwe-flag-strip {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 8px;
            height: 100vh;
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .flag-green { background: #00A651; flex: 1; }
        .flag-yellow { background: #FDD116; flex: 1; }
        .flag-red { background: #EF3340; flex: 1; }
        .flag-black { background: #000000; flex: 1; }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 40px 0 60px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .section {
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 120px 0;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: all 1s ease-out;
        }

        .section.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .hero-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-content {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            padding: 80px 70px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            max-width: 900px;
            border-left: 6px solid #00A651;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 4.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: #4d5657;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: #34495e;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .content-section {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 80px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 120px;
        }

        .content-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            padding: 60px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transform: translateX(-50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
            border-left: 6px solid #00A651;
        }

        .content-box.visible {
            transform: translateX(0);
        }

        .content-box.right {
            transform: translateX(50px);
            border-left: none;
            border-right: 6px solid #EF3340;
        }

        .content-box.right.visible {
            transform: translateX(0);
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .section-text {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #34495e;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border: 2px solid #00A651;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .quote-box {
            background: #fff5f5;
            border: 2px solid #EF3340;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: 500;
            position: relative;
        }

        .quote-box::before {
            content: '"';
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: #EF3340;
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            left: 20px;
            opacity: 0.3;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
        }

        .image-container {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            height: 450px;
        }

        .image-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.6s ease;
        }

        .image-container:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .image-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85));
            color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .full-width-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            padding: 80px 60px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 80px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-left: 6px solid #FDD116;
        }

        .capabilities-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(320px, 100%), 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin: 60px 0;
        }

        .capability-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #e9ecef;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: left;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .capability-card:hover {
            border-color: #00A651;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .capability-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .capability-card p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #3f4d59;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .question-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(400px, 100%), 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin: 60px 0;
        }

        .question-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #e9ecef;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .question-card:nth-child(1) { border-left: 6px solid #00A651; }
        .question-card:nth-child(2) { border-left: 6px solid #EF3340; }
        .question-card:nth-child(3) { border-left: 6px solid #FDD116; }
        .question-card:nth-child(4) { border-left: 6px solid #000000; }

        .question-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .question-card h4 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .question-card p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #3f4d59;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .closing-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            padding: 80px 60px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin: 80px 0;
            border: 2px solid #34495e;
        }

        .closing-title {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .closing-text {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: #34495e;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .journey-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 50px 0 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .journey-item {
            position: relative;
            padding: 0 0 40px 40px;
            border-left: 3px solid #e9ecef;
        }

        .journey-item:last-child {
            padding-bottom: 0;
            border-left-color: transparent;
        }

        .journey-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: -11px;
            top: 4px;
            width: 19px;
            height: 19px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 4px solid #00A651;
        }

        .journey-item:nth-child(even)::before {
            border-color: #FDD116;
        }

        .journey-meta {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #4d5657;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .journey-item h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .journey-item p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #3f4d59;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .work-columns {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(340px, 100%), 1fr));
            gap: 50px;
            margin: 50px 0 0;
        }

        .work-column h3 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #4d5657;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .work-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .work-list li {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #e9ecef;
            border-left: 6px solid #00A651;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .work-column:nth-child(2) .work-list li {
            border-left-color: #EF3340;
        }

        .work-list li:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .work-list strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .work-list span {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #3f4d59;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .work-list a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(0, 166, 81, 0.4);
        }

        .work-list a:hover {
            border-bottom-color: #00A651;
        }

        .page-footer {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 50px 60px;
            margin: 0 0 80px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .page-footer p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #3f4d59;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /*
         * The Zimbabwe green, darkened — and only here.
         *
         * #00A651 is the flag's green and it draws thirteen other things on
         * this page: the strip, the quote borders, the card rules, the avatar
         * ring. All of those are marks, and a mark's contrast floor is Lc 45,
         * which it clears. A link is read, and its floor is Lc 75 — as the
         * brand green it measured Lc 52.5, needing 26px for a 17.6px line. So
         * the mark keeps the brand colour and the text takes a darker cut of
         * the same hue.
         */
        .page-footer a {
            color: #046c36;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(0, 166, 81, 0.35);
        }

        .page-footer a:hover {
            border-bottom-color: #00A651;
        }

        .scroll-indicator {
            position: fixed;
            right: 30px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        /* Astro scopes styles to elements in the template, and these dots are
           created at runtime by buildScrollDots() - so they need :global(). */
        :global(.scroll-dot) {
            display: block;
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            padding: 0;
            appearance: none;
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        :global(.scroll-dot:focus-visible) {
            outline: 2px solid #ffffff;
            outline-offset: 3px;
        }

        :global(.scroll-dot.active) {
            background: #00A651;
            border-color: #ffffff;
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        .zimbabwe-flag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-right: 15px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .daniel-pink-link {
            color: #2980b9;
            text-decoration: underline;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .daniel-pink-link:hover {
            color: #3498db;
        }

        /* Popup Modal Styles */
        .popup-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            z-index: 2000;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .popup-overlay.show {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out;
        }

        .popup-content {
            background: white;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            max-width: 800px;
            max-height: 80vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            margin: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            position: relative;
            animation: slideIn 0.3s ease-out;
        }

        .popup-close {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 25px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #999;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .popup-close:hover {
            color: #333;
        }

        .popup-title {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 300;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #3498db;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .popup-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #4d5657;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .popup-section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .popup-section h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #2980b9;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .popup-section p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #34495e;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .popup-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .popup-list li {
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }

        .popup-list li strong {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .popup-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .popup-link:hover {
            background: #2980b9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.3);
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from { 
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-50px);
            }
            to { 
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .container {
                padding: 0 30px;
            }
            
            .content-section {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 60px;
            }
            
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 3.5rem;
            }
            
            .capabilities-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .question-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .popup-content {
                padding: 30px;
                margin: 10px;
            }
        }

                /* Loading Screen Styles */
        .loading-screen {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00A651, #FDD116);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 9999;
            transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out;
        }

        .loading-screen.fade-out {
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .loading-title {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .loading-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .loading-spinner {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 50%;
            border-top-color: white;
            animation: spin 1s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .zimbabwe-flag-loading {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-content,
            .page-footer {
                padding: 40px 25px;
            }

            .work-columns {
                gap: 40px;
            }

            .content-section {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 40px;
                margin-bottom: 60px;
            }

            .content-box,
            .full-width-section {
                padding: 40px;
            }
            
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 2.3rem;
            }

            .popup-content {
                padding: 30px;
                margin: 10px;
            }

            .popup-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }

            .loading-title {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .loading-subtitle {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Loading Screen -->
    <div class="loading-screen" id="loadingScreen">
        <div class="zimbabwe-flag-loading">🇿🇼</div>
        <h1 class="loading-title">Origins with perspective</h1>
        <p class="loading-subtitle">Equity: Assumptions we make in Learning</p>
        <div class="loading-spinner"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Zimbabwe Flag Strip -->
    <div class="zimbabwe-flag-strip">
        <div class="flag-green"></div>
        <div class="flag-yellow"></div>
        <div class="flag-red"></div>
        <div class="flag-black"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll Navigation (dots are generated from the sections on the page) -->
    <nav class="scroll-indicator" id="scrollIndicator" aria-label="Section navigation"></nav>

    <!-- Daniel Pink Popup -->
    <div class="popup-overlay" id="danielPinkPopup">
        <div class="popup-content">
            <span class="popup-close" onclick="closeDanielPinkPopup()">&times;</span>
            <h2 class="popup-title">What You'll Learn in "A Whole New Mind"</h2>
            <p class="popup-subtitle">Key insights from Daniel Pink's groundbreaking book</p>
            
            <div class="popup-section">
                <p>The structure of our brains offers a metaphor for the contours of our times. We're moving from a world that prizes metaphorically "left brain" skills (logical, linear, spreadsheet skills) to one that prizes more "right brain" skills (artistry, empathy, big picture thinking.)</p>
            </div>

            <div class="popup-section">
                <h3>Three Forces Driving Change</h3>
                <p><strong>Abundance, Automation, and Asia.</strong> Significantly higher living standards have put a premium on creating new categories of products and services and enhancing existing offerings with greater beauty and meaning. Software, and now AI, has become adept at doing certain routine intellectual work faster and better than humans. And offshoring has driven down the price of that reductive work.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="popup-section">
                <h3>The New Essential Abilities</h3>
                <p>The most important abilities are no longer high tech – but <strong>"high concept"</strong> and <strong>"high touch."</strong> These abilities are hard to outsource, hard to automate, and deliver on the new demands of an abundant world.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="popup-section">
                <h3>Core High Concept Abilities</h3>
                <ul class="popup-list">
                    <li><strong>Design:</strong> Combining utility and significance - thinking like a designer</li>
                    <li><strong>Story:</strong> Putting facts in context and delivering them with emotional impact</li>
                    <li><strong>Symphony:</strong> Combining disparate pieces into a whole greater than the sum of its parts</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="popup-section">
                <h3>Core High Touch Abilities</h3>
                <ul class="popup-list">
                    <li><strong>Empathy:</strong> See with others' eyes, hear with others' ears, and feel with others' hearts</li>
                    <li><strong>Play:</strong> Not only a source of joy, but also a pathway to more intense creativity and inspiration</li>
                    <li><strong>Meaning:</strong> The pursuit of meaning and significance has taken on new importance in a world of increasing material well-being</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <a href="https://www.danpink.com/books/whole-new-mind/" target="_blank" class="popup-link">Learn More About "A Whole New Mind"</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!--
      A <main>, not a <div>. The deck's twelve sections were the whole of the
      page's content and none of it sat in a landmark, so a screen reader had
      no way to skip the loading screen, the flag strip and the popup to reach
      the talk. `.container` is a class selector, so the styling is untouched.
    -->
    <main class="container">
        
